{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":38927,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"081c6ae1c87d0a7af5c740ebb75ed2cb","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have all the information needed. Let me now build the design. I'll plan:\n\n**Design system:**\n- Primary: #31A062\n- Background: #F6F7F9 (light gray) or white\n- Text primary: #1A1D26 (dark)\n- Text secondary: #8B8E98\n- Success/gain: #31A062\n- Error: #E5484D\n- Card: #FFFFFF\n- Border: #E5E7EB\n- Radius: 20 for buttons/fields, 16 for cards\n\n**Fonts:** DM Sans for headings/numbers, Inter for body/labels\n\n**Frames (414×932):**\n1. 01_Splash — logo centered, auto-advance → 02_Welcome\n2. 02_Welcome — illustration, copy, Create account button, Login link → 03_Create_Account_Empty\n3. 03_Create_Account_Empty — form with 3 empty fields, disabled Create account, back, Login link\n4. 03_Create_Account_Filled — form filled, Create account enabled → 04_Home\n5. 03_Create_Account_Error — email invalid, error message\n6. 04_Home — greeting, menu, notification, portfolio, Invest now, Best Plans, Investment Guide articles, bottom nav\n7. 05_My_Asset_Overlay — bottom sheet over Home: My Asset, portfolio, Current Plans (Gold), History 4 items, See All Plans, close\n8. 06_Notification — back, Notification title, 3 notifications\n9. 07_Profile — avatar, Jonas Macroni, Expert, menu entries, bottom nav with Account selected\n10. 08_Contact_Info — avatar with edit, details list with Change, missing items with Add, back\n11. 09_Bank_Account_Info — 2 bank accounts, Add account button, back\n\nLet me build this step by step. First, create reusable components in the Workspace page, then the 11 frames.\n\nActually, I need to be efficient. Let me create components first:\n1. Tab bar component (Home active / Account active)\n2. Button Primary (reuse the existing component 6:7 as instance)\n3. Text Field instances from 6:23\n4. Status bar + home indicator from 48:43 and 48:54\n\nLet me write a comprehensive script that creates everything. I'll break it into multiple use_figma calls to stay under limits.\n\nLet me start with loading fonts and setting up the workspace page.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3394a1fc-48e8-404f-9f28-7846423ba2bb","uuid":"7143e83d-8520-4ee8-98ee-dbc6948a11a0","timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:03:54.660Z","thinking_duration_ms":9983}
